msgid ""
"Use shortcode on any page or widget. You can also add the Language Switcher "
"Block in the WP Gutenberg Editor."
msgstr ""
"Použite shortcode na ľubovoľnej stránke alebo vo widgete. Prepínač jazykov "
"môžete pridať aj ako blok v editore WP Gutenberg."

#: assets/js/trp-lang-switcher-configurator.js:2
#, tp-ai, tp-glo-da70db08
msgid "Shortcode"
msgstr "Shortcode"

#: assets/js/trp-lang-switcher-configurator.js:2
#, tp-ai
msgid "Additional Settings"
msgstr "Ďalšie nastavenia"

#: assets/js/trp-lang-switcher-configurator.js:2
#, tp-ai, tp-glo-da70db08
msgid ""
"Open the language switcher shortcode by clicking on it instead of hovering. "
"<br> Close it by clicking on it, anywhere else on the screen or by pressing "
"the escape key. <br> This will affect only the shortcode language switcher."
msgstr ""
"Otvorte shortcode prepínača jazykov kliknutím naň namiesto prejdenia myšou. "
"<br> Zatvorte ho kliknutím naň, na ľubovoľné iné miesto na obrazovke alebo "
"stlačením klávesu Escape. <br> Toto ovplyvní iba shortcode prepínača "
"jazykov."

#: assets/js/trp-lang-switcher-configurator.js:2
#, tp-ai
msgid "Menu Switcher Layout"
msgstr "Rozloženie prepínača v menu"

#: assets/js/trp-lang-switcher-configurator.js:2
#, tp-ai, tp-glo-5e752340, tp-glo-ee8b4f9f
msgid ""
"Go to <a href=\"/wp-admin/nav-menus.php\">Appearance → Menus</a> to add "
"languages to the Language Switcher in any menu.<br> <a "
"href=\"https://translatepress.com/docs/settings/language-switcher/?utm_"
"source=tp-language-switcher&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=ls-menu-"
"item#menu-switcher\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more in our documentation.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Prejdite na <a href=\"/wp-admin/nav-menus.php\">Vzhľad → Menu</a>, ak "
"chcete pridať jazyky do prepínača jazykov v ľubovoľnom menu.<br> <a "
"href=\"https://translatepress.com/docs/settings/language-switcher/?utm_"
"source=tp-language-switcher&utm_medium=client-site&utm_campaign=ls-menu-"
"item#menu-switcher\" target=\"_blank\">Ďalšie informácie nájdete v našej "
"dokumentácii.</a>"

